      "id": 1,
      "text": "Neihart grew from a homesteading and railroad hub and was renamed after James LeRoy Neihart, an uncle of poet John Neihardt.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
